116
00:03:47.891 --> 00:03:49.433
twenty-eight in thirty-two.

117
00:03:49.776 --> 00:03:51.317
Zero point seven eight one.

118
00:03:51.814 --> 00:03:54.352
Kappa is zero point eight seven five minus

119
00:03:54.352 --> 00:03:57.009
