120
00:03:57.009 --> 00:03:59.606
zero point seven eight one: zero point

121
00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:00.255
four three.

122
00:04:00.609 --> 00:04:02.852
Exactly NOC's reading for this window.

123
00:04:03.207 --> 00:04:05.863
They match here because a equals b, so the

124
00:04:05.863 --> 00:04:07.870
best case gives kappa exactly one.

125
00:04:09.279 --> 00:04:11.235
Now make the drums dense: twenty-eight

126
00:04:11.235 --> 00:04:11.458
